id=nemu_boot_autostart
name=Nemu Boot Guard
version=1.10
versionCode=11
author=Nemu
description=Auto-unbrick guard (3 failed boots): verified clean shutdowns reset the counter; bounded suspend/component recovery with verification; only Nemu-owned disable-user packages and components are restored. v1.10 removes the boot-time UI launch (Nemu no longer pops up automatically); recovery still runs via the app's BootReceiver.
